   "description": "<div><b>User Story:</b><br></div><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%; margin-top: 0px\"><br></p><div><b>As a Provider&nbsp;</b>user,<br></div><div><b>I want</b> to log into the system and perform granted functions like\nuploading invoices, updating uploaded files, and exporting paid invoices,<br></div><div><b>so that</b> I can manage and process invoices efficiently.<br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b><br></div><p><br></p><ol style=\"margin-top: 0in\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\"><b>User Authentication</b>:<br></li><ul style=\"margin-top: 0in\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Users must be able to log in using a\n      secure authentication mechanism (username/password, two-factor\n      authentication).<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Display appropriate error messages\n      for failed login attempts (e.g., incorrect credentials, account locked).<br></li></ul><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\"><b>Role-Based Access Control</b>:<br></li><ul style=\"margin-top: 0in\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Users should have access to\n      functions based on their roles and permissions.<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Define roles such as Admin, Manager,\n      and Regular User, with corresponding access rights.<br></li></ul><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\"><b>Invoice Upload Functionality</b>:<br></li><ul style=\"margin-top: 0in\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Users with the appropriate\n      permissions should be able to upload invoice files (PDF, Excel, CSV).<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Validate the uploaded file format\n      and content before processing.<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Provide a confirmation message upon\n      successful upload and an error message for failed attempts.<br></li></ul><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\"><b>Update Uploaded File</b>:<br></li><ul style=\"margin-top: 0in\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Allow users to view a list of their\n      uploaded invoices.<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Provide an option to update or\n      replace an existing uploaded invoice.<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Ensure changes are logged and\n      tracked for audit purposes.<br></li></ul><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\"><b>Export Paid Invoices</b>:<br></li><ul style=\"margin-top: 0in\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Users should be able to filter and\n      export a list of paid invoices.<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Support export formats such as PDF,\n      Excel, and CSV.<br></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%\">Ensure the export process is secure\n      and that data integrity is maintained.<br></li></ul></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%; margin-top: 0px\"><br></p><div><br></div><p><br></p><div><br></div>",
